          <div class="cta-desc">Urge lawmakers to protect hunger-relief programs in your community.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-card">
        <div class="cta-icon fundraise">🤝</div>
        <div class="cta-content">
          <div class="cta-title">Fundraise</div>
          <div class="cta-desc">Rally your community — inspire collective action and shared purpose.</div>
